%description:
Tests TcpSocket::setKeepAlive() on an open connection (SO_KEEPALIVE; RFC 9293
MUST-24: the application turns keepalive on or off for each connection). The
keepAliveEnabled parameter is off. The client application turns keepalive on
at t=10, so the idle time of 30 s ends at t=40 and the client sends a probe.
The application turns keepalive off at t=50, so no probe follows up to t=100
(the client sends three segments in all).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 100s
*.cli_app.keepAliveScript="10 1; 50 0"
*.cli_tcp.keepAliveIdleTime = 30s
*.cli_tcp.keepAliveInterval = 5s

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[40.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[40.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Sending keepalive probe, seq=0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
tcpdump finished, A:3 B:2 segments
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
